  data: {
    LLM: "Count points as they fall. Remember there are 146 total points, so you need 100 for the 2-point score. The last trick (5 points) can be decisive in close games.\n\nTrump Management: Save your trumps for when they can capture high-point cards. The trump Jack (20 points) and Nine (14 points) are crucial. Don't waste trumps on low-value tricks.\n\nVoid Creation: Try to exhaust one suit early so you can trump when that suit is led. This is especially powerful if you have several trumps. Signal to your partner through your lead choices - leading a low card often suggests strength in that suit or a desire for partner to take the trick.",
    Player: "Count points as they fall. Remember there are 146 total points, so you need 100 for the 2-point score. The last trick (5 points) can be decisive in close games.\n\nTrump Management: Save your trumps for when they can capture high-point cards. The trump Jack (20 points) and Nine (14 points) are crucial. Don't waste trumps on low-value tricks.\n\nVoid Creation: Try to exhaust one suit early so you can trump when that suit is led. This is especially powerful if you have several trumps. Signal to your partner through your lead choices - leading a low card often suggests strength in that suit or a desire for partner to take the trick.",
